.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents a single parameter definition used by an \fBIModelTool<T>\fP\&. 

A \fBModelToolParameter\fP describes the name, \&.NET type, and human‑readable description of a tool parameter\&. 
.br
 Tool factories and \fBAI\fP backends use this metadata to construct parameter schemas, validate input, and expose structured tool interfaces to models\&. 
.PP
